    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/b9cbeef8c7229111cdaad02e1059f5d9.poster.avif?t=1626549598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/b9cbeef8c7229111cdaad02e1059f5d9.webm?t=1626549598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/b9cbeef8c7229111cdaad02e1059f5d9.mp4?t=1626549598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Sand Witch Adventures is a roguelike game with bullet-hell elements.<br>Cursed lands full of undead are fraught with wealth and knowledge for the young<br>witches. She decides to definitely go on this adventure, despite<br>no matter what. Sandstorms, icy deserts, dense forests, red lands - all these<br>locations will become more and more difficult to overcome.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/0a672de63477df6ea8e449f42af78a62.poster.avif?t=1626549598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/0a672de63477df6ea8e449f42af78a62.webm?t=1626549598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/0a672de63477df6ea8e449f42af78a62.mp4?t=1626549598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Features:<br>- The system of pumping from race to race.<br>- Several unique biomes.<br>- Random generation of levels.<br>- Several types of enemies and their attacks.<br><br>Ready to travel with a young witch? Then go ahead! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/c4459e63206c534e95bb1260cc66f43f.poster.avif?t=1626549598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/c4459e63206c534e95bb1260cc66f43f.webm?t=1626549598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393620/extras/c4459e63206c534e95bb1260cc66f43f.mp4?t=1626549598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
